1
00:00:00,231 --> 00:00:02,491
(Sheldon:)Spread your legs, invite them in.

2
00:00:07,806 --> 00:00:12,076
(Howard:)I'm telling you, something's wrong.
I can always feel it when Raj is in trouble.

3
00:00:12,243 --> 00:00:14,673
Jeez, how close were you
before we got married?

4
00:00:14,846 --> 00:00:16,746
(Leonard:)Don't look under that rock.

5
00:00:18,249 --> 00:00:20,219
- Raj, you okay?
- You in there?

6
00:00:20,385 --> 00:00:21,405
(Raj(off):)Go away.

7
00:00:22,687 --> 00:00:25,317
- Come on, buddy, open up.
- We're worried about you.

8
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:28,480
Oh, just because I stop going to work
and answering my phone...

9
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:31,250
(Raj(off):)...you think something bad happened?

10
00:00:31,429 --> 00:00:33,629
(Raj(off):)Maybe something good happened.

11
00:00:33,932 --> 00:00:35,662
(Bernadette:)Did something good happen?

12
00:00:35,834 --> 00:00:38,924
Of course not, nothing good ever happens!

13
00:00:43,975 --> 00:00:46,025
(Leonard:)Whoa.

